      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OCCULENT (5) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 1.5 lengths second (22.51) in a Grade 5 at Maitland. Key player on best and worth another chance. MAEVE BABY (1) showed blistering pace early and gave a sight when in the minors, beaten 6 lengths over 400m this track in 22.95. Expecting another good run. DURAN QUEEN (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Semi Peakin' (23.08) in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Can measure up. KAELIX COMET (7) has strong credentials from this draw.",
